    {
      "source": "<a href=\"QueryByExamplePredicateBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jpa.convert\"><code>QueryByExamplePredicateBuilder</code></a> creates a single <code>CriteriaBuilder.and(Predicate...)</code> combined\n<code>Predicate</code> for a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>. <br/>\nThe builder includes any <code>SingularAttribute</code> of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html#getProbe()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example.getProbe()</code></a> applying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> and\nnull matching strategies configured on the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>. Ignored paths are no matter of their actual\nvalue not considered. <br/>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"QueryByExamplePredicateBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jpa.convert\"><code>QueryByExamplePredicateBuilder</code></a> 为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 创建一个单一的、由 <code>CriteriaBuilder.and(Predicate...)</code> 组合而成的 <code>Predicate</code>。<br/>\n该构建器包含 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html#getProbe()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example.getProbe()</code></a> 上的任意 <code>SingularAttribute</code>，并应用配置在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Example.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 上的 <code>String</code> 和 null 匹配策略。被忽略的路径无论其实际值如何均不予考虑。<br/>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "null indicates no <code>Predicate</code>.",
      "translation": "null 表示没有 <code>Predicate</code>。",
      "count": 1
